# The switch, and the first skill in the game the player uses rather than
# holds. While it is on, the Bishop's four Benevolence skills stand as their
# Vengeance forms -- see the vengeance folder, and Skill.toggle.
#
# What it grants is not gated on the switch: GMS marks it "[Passive Effects]",
# which is permanent once the skill is learned. The switch trades the party's
# fountains and the Bishop's own Heal for four attacks, which is choice enough.
#
# GMS also cuts 10% off the enemy's elemental resistance, which nothing here
# has. Its half-second cooldown is the gap between two presses of the switch
# and means nothing to a fight.
name: "Righteously Indignant"
description:
  "Fuel your body with the fury of an avenging angel. Converts Benevolence "
  "skills to Vengeance skills."
kind: SKILL_KIND_ACTIVE
placement { job_advancement: JOB_ADVANCEMENT_BISHOP skill_order: 1 }
hyper: true
required_level: 140
max_level: 1
toggle: true
base {
  magic_attack: 50
  final_dmg_pct: 0.30
  ied_pct: 0.20
}
